WEBVTT

01:49.350 --> 01:54.990
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.030 --> 01:57.960
[Episode 16]

02:00.280 --> 02:02.150
Are you restless

02:02.280 --> 02:05.540
because of the marriage between
the Song and Chu families?

02:07.790 --> 02:09.400
It's not difficult.

02:10.590 --> 02:12.920
Doesn't Song Yude have a second daughter?

02:13.560 --> 02:15.290
If you can't marry Song Yimeng,

02:15.400 --> 02:16.980
then marry Song Yiting.

02:17.030 --> 02:18.960
There's always a second option.

02:21.710 --> 02:22.520
No.

02:24.560 --> 02:25.590
Why not?

02:27.630 --> 02:29.280
Song Yiting is meticulous

02:29.360 --> 02:30.360
and intelligent.

02:30.870 --> 02:32.360
If I marry her,

02:32.360 --> 02:34.030
won't I be asking for trouble?

02:36.190 --> 02:37.400
Being meticulous

02:37.400 --> 02:38.750
and intelligent

02:39.520 --> 02:41.720
are the character traits of a good wife.

02:43.190 --> 02:45.710
Do you have to marry a crazy woman

02:45.710 --> 02:47.840
like Song Yimeng?

02:48.870 --> 02:51.040
Song Yimeng is pretending to be crazy.

02:51.400 --> 02:53.460
Those are her tricks to hide herself.

02:54.520 --> 02:55.800
That's strange.

02:57.590 --> 03:00.080
Instead of an intelligent wife,

03:01.280 --> 03:03.870
you want a cunning woman
who pretends

03:03.870 --> 03:05.240
to be crazy.

03:07.280 --> 03:08.360
It doesn't matter.

03:08.750 --> 03:12.120
What matters is to stop the marriage
between the Song and Chu families.

03:12.120 --> 03:14.380
Then marry both daughters.

03:14.520 --> 03:15.720
Marry a virtuous wife

03:16.000 --> 03:17.600
and have a pretty concubine.

03:19.590 --> 03:20.430
Ridiculous!

03:20.710 --> 03:21.910
With all due respect,

03:22.800 --> 03:25.190
if you want to fight for the throne,

03:25.360 --> 03:28.750
you mustn't waste your time on love.

03:29.240 --> 03:30.470
With your tactics,

03:30.560 --> 03:33.150
it won't be difficult to
ruin this marriage.

03:33.280 --> 03:35.280
Why bother being upset

03:35.710 --> 03:37.640
and affecting the important plan?

03:45.000 --> 03:45.860
Your Highness,

03:47.310 --> 03:48.910
your attendant is too hot-tempered.

03:48.910 --> 03:50.910
He crossed
a high-ranking official's daughter.

03:50.910 --> 03:51.750
Please

03:51.960 --> 03:52.870
take a look.

03:59.520 --> 04:00.910
Why didn't you stop her?

04:00.910 --> 04:03.150
You haven't learned your lesson
from last time?

04:03.150 --> 04:03.750
No,

04:03.750 --> 04:04.190
Chief.

04:04.190 --> 04:05.680
It’s not my fault.

04:05.800 --> 04:06.800
Miss Song

04:06.800 --> 04:09.030
came in with the notice for the
method of weapon forging.

04:09.030 --> 04:10.230
Who dares to stop her?

04:13.160 --> 04:14.260
What notice?

04:16.040 --> 04:17.510
Don't tell me you took an important thing

04:17.510 --> 04:18.310
like the method of weapon forging

04:18.310 --> 04:19.510
and posted it all over the streets.

04:19.510 --> 04:20.480
I didn't put that up.

04:20.480 --> 04:21.560
Don't yell at me.

04:21.560 --> 04:22.690
Who else could it be?

04:25.120 --> 04:28.820
[A few days ago]

04:25.360 --> 04:26.510
Go secretly find

04:26.510 --> 04:27.800
knowledgeable people

04:27.920 --> 04:28.950
and see if anyone

04:29.080 --> 04:30.280
can read these words.

04:30.430 --> 04:31.190
Okay.

04:31.190 --> 04:31.830
Yunlong,

04:32.110 --> 04:33.360
find the clues in secret.

04:33.360 --> 04:34.490
If you can't find it,

04:34.510 --> 04:35.600
don't bother coming back.

04:35.600 --> 04:36.430
Got it?

04:37.680 --> 04:38.270
Shanhu,

04:38.800 --> 04:39.600
find clues.

04:42.480 --> 04:43.950
What is this gibberish?

04:43.950 --> 04:45.409
Where can I find any clues?

04:46.000 --> 04:47.960
What if I can't find any?

04:49.050 --> 04:50.390
Yunlong already told me

04:50.390 --> 04:51.600
that if you can't find any clues,

04:51.600 --> 04:52.800
he'll chop your head off.

04:52.800 --> 04:53.480
Yes.

04:54.240 --> 04:55.360
Chief has given the order.

04:55.360 --> 04:56.750
If any of you can't find any clues,

04:56.750 --> 04:58.270
he'll chop off your head.

05:02.720 --> 05:04.720
I have a lot of work to do,

05:04.720 --> 05:06.800
so I had Yunlong and Shanhu do it.

05:06.800 --> 05:07.800
But I didn't expect

05:07.800 --> 05:09.480
they'd be so stupid.

05:09.480 --> 05:10.000
Yes,

05:10.000 --> 05:11.190
you're not stupid.

05:11.950 --> 05:13.270
You're just lazy!

05:15.070 --> 05:16.950
I didn't save you from
the celestial prison

05:16.950 --> 05:18.410
for you to be a freeloader.

05:21.720 --> 05:22.510
Wait.

05:23.040 --> 05:23.970
Mechanical arm.

05:24.830 --> 05:25.880
Hurry up.

05:29.870 --> 05:31.040
You're so slow.

05:33.560 --> 05:34.120
This...

05:35.310 --> 05:36.680
Are you doing this on purpose?

05:36.680 --> 05:37.390
-Let me.
-How many times has it been?

05:37.390 --> 05:38.560
Let me do it.

05:39.240 --> 05:40.390
You are so stupid.

05:40.390 --> 05:41.190
Don’t move.

05:41.190 --> 05:42.000
Mr. Li!

05:42.000 --> 05:42.430
Let me.

05:42.430 --> 05:42.870
Mr. Li!

05:42.870 --> 05:43.920
You’re pressing my hair.

05:43.920 --> 05:44.720
Be gentle.

05:57.950 --> 05:59.560
S-Sorry.

06:00.160 --> 06:01.000
Excuse me.

06:03.310 --> 06:03.950
No.

06:03.950 --> 06:04.480
He...

06:04.480 --> 06:05.190
He...

06:05.750 --> 06:06.800
He...

06:10.630 --> 06:11.430
Song Yimeng!

06:11.950 --> 06:12.750
Hey.

06:12.950 --> 06:13.750
Miss Song!

06:13.750 --> 06:14.680
Miss Song, just now...

06:14.680 --> 06:15.430
Mr. Li.

06:15.630 --> 06:16.560
Just now...

06:16.600 --> 06:18.120
You don't have to explain to me.

06:18.120 --> 06:18.920
You...

06:20.720 --> 06:22.800
It's not a big deal.

06:23.000 --> 06:23.920
Don't be nervous.

06:23.920 --> 06:24.680
I understand everything.

06:24.680 --> 06:26.160
What do you understand?

06:26.160 --> 06:26.680
No,

06:26.680 --> 06:27.190
I just...

06:27.190 --> 06:27.870
Chief.

06:29.740 --> 06:30.670
What do you want?

06:36.630 --> 06:38.500
What are you doing?

06:41.190 --> 06:42.040
The notice.

06:42.190 --> 06:43.000
Clues.

06:43.310 --> 06:44.370
Second Master said

06:44.600 --> 06:46.060
I must report intimately.

06:50.680 --> 06:52.120
I'm talking to Miss Song.

06:52.120 --> 06:52.680
Let's talk about it later.

06:52.680 --> 06:53.390
Chief!

06:54.390 --> 06:56.000
The new guys from
the northwest are here.

06:56.000 --> 06:57.970
They're all so muscular.

06:58.190 --> 07:00.000
Most importantly, they have good skills.

07:00.000 --> 07:01.460
Do you want to give it a try?

07:01.510 --> 07:02.620
We'll talk later.

07:10.160 --> 07:11.300
No,

07:12.000 --> 07:14.240
he's talking about weapon forgers.

07:17.000 --> 07:18.340
Weapon forgers?

07:18.600 --> 07:19.270
I understand.

07:19.270 --> 07:20.400
I understand it all.

07:20.750 --> 07:22.210
I understand everything.

07:23.070 --> 07:23.800
What do you understand?

07:23.800 --> 07:25.000
You don't look like you understand.

07:25.000 --> 07:26.720
He's talking about weapon forgers!

07:26.720 --> 07:27.360
He...

07:28.830 --> 07:29.630
Shangguan He, come here.

07:29.630 --> 07:31.160
Hurry. You're just in time.

07:32.190 --> 07:33.040
Now,

07:33.480 --> 07:34.920
tell Miss Song

07:34.920 --> 07:36.270
about everything that just happened

07:36.270 --> 07:37.120
in the room.

07:37.120 --> 07:37.800
I can't tell her about

07:37.800 --> 07:39.460
your identity change, right?

07:39.800 --> 07:41.750
Mr. Zhang from the west of the city
came to see you.

07:41.750 --> 07:42.360
He said

07:42.360 --> 07:43.800
the lives of his three sons

07:43.800 --> 07:44.800
are in your hands now.

07:44.800 --> 07:46.159
Please treat them...

07:51.360 --> 07:52.240
Gently.

08:04.580 --> 08:05.870
Okay.

08:13.270 --> 08:15.270
I told you to explain what happened
in the room.

08:15.270 --> 08:16.680
Did you explain it to her?

08:16.680 --> 08:16.870
Wait,

08:16.870 --> 08:17.800
what should I explain?

08:17.800 --> 08:18.630
Mr. Li,

08:19.040 --> 08:21.170
you really don't have to explain to me.

08:21.760 --> 08:23.390
I understand.

08:23.630 --> 08:24.950
Don't show

08:25.040 --> 08:25.920
this thing

08:25.920 --> 08:27.270
to others again.

08:28.160 --> 08:29.450
Since you are...

08:30.950 --> 08:31.750
You are...

08:32.549 --> 08:33.360
You...

08:34.270 --> 08:35.080
You all...

08:35.789 --> 08:36.600
I...

08:37.150 --> 08:37.960
You...

08:38.390 --> 08:39.200
You...

08:41.150 --> 08:43.030
Take it as my wishful thinking.

08:43.480 --> 08:44.930
In the future,

08:46.170 --> 08:47.800
let's never meet again!

08:48.840 --> 08:49.750
Song Yimeng!

08:49.840 --> 08:50.960
No, I...

08:56.080 --> 08:57.720
You did it on purpose, didn't you?

08:57.720 --> 08:58.510
I...

09:19.200 --> 09:20.330
No wonder

09:21.200 --> 09:23.000
your men

09:23.910 --> 09:25.970
said you're not interested in women.

09:32.200 --> 09:33.240
No wonder

09:33.240 --> 09:35.640
you're with that
Shangguan He all day long.

09:41.750 --> 09:43.670
And that day,

09:43.810 --> 09:44.630
you let me take a look at the wound.

09:44.630 --> 09:46.150
It's late and we're alone.

09:46.150 --> 09:47.750
We'd better keep a distance.

09:47.960 --> 09:49.910
But that's Chief's private domain.

09:49.910 --> 09:51.240
But don't worry.

09:51.330 --> 09:52.960
There are definitely no women there.

09:52.960 --> 09:54.620
The Chief doesn't like women!

10:06.060 --> 10:09.310
So that's where you hide your lover.

10:15.960 --> 10:17.000
What a pity.

10:18.120 --> 10:19.270
My love

10:20.670 --> 10:22.080
has ended

10:22.790 --> 10:24.390
before it even started.

10:37.320 --> 10:38.120
Song Yimeng.

10:48.000 --> 10:48.960
You're here?

10:49.240 --> 10:50.400
My bestie.

10:52.000 --> 10:53.030
Sit down.

10:53.440 --> 10:54.610
Have a seat.

10:56.790 --> 10:58.480
It's dangerous to drink on a rooftop alone

10:58.480 --> 10:59.940
in the middle of the night.

11:02.000 --> 11:03.330
Let me tell you.

11:04.000 --> 11:05.960
I thought you were good to me

11:07.120 --> 11:08.600
because you liked me.

11:09.630 --> 11:11.360
I didn’t expect this, Mr. Li.

11:14.000 --> 11:15.080
I didn’t expect

11:15.750 --> 11:18.480
you only see me as a bestie.

11:20.750 --> 11:22.510
It's not what you think.

11:22.510 --> 11:23.150
I...

11:24.960 --> 11:26.000
Shush!

11:26.550 --> 11:27.600
Shush!

11:28.550 --> 11:29.790
There are so many people here.

11:29.790 --> 11:31.690
It won't be good if they hear your secret.

11:31.690 --> 11:32.910
It's bad for you.

11:33.670 --> 11:34.320
Understand?

11:34.320 --> 11:35.030
Enough.

11:36.080 --> 11:37.480
Listen to me, Song Yimeng.

11:37.480 --> 11:39.240
Listen to me carefully.

11:39.320 --> 11:40.120
I...

11:40.790 --> 11:42.200
don't like men.

11:42.200 --> 11:43.080
Do you hear me?

11:45.030 --> 11:45.840
You...

11:46.080 --> 11:47.440
don't like men?

11:47.440 --> 11:48.080
Yes.

11:48.510 --> 11:50.030
So you just

11:50.960 --> 11:53.700
simply like Shangguan He?

11:53.790 --> 11:55.240
Are you an idiot?

11:55.870 --> 11:58.120
If my relationship with Shangguan He
is like that,

11:58.120 --> 11:59.790
then is everyone in Waning River Crescent

11:59.790 --> 12:01.050
blind and can't see it?

12:03.720 --> 12:04.520
What's wrong?

12:06.440 --> 12:08.440
You don't only like Shangguan He?

12:09.440 --> 12:10.600
Who else?

12:12.630 --> 12:13.650
Yunlong

12:14.600 --> 12:15.750
and Shanhu?

12:17.550 --> 12:18.790
Or is it that...

12:18.790 --> 12:19.550
That...

12:19.630 --> 12:21.200
Those Northwestern boys?

12:21.200 --> 12:21.720
I mean...

12:21.720 --> 12:22.510
Alright.

12:22.630 --> 12:23.600
Don't say anything.

12:23.600 --> 12:26.130
I’m afraid it’ll be harder
for me to accept it.

12:29.000 --> 12:30.600
I know, Mr. Li.

12:32.240 --> 12:33.640
You can’t force yourself

12:34.750 --> 12:36.240
to like someone.

12:36.470 --> 12:38.200
I know all of this.

12:38.320 --> 12:39.630
I really know.

12:41.000 --> 12:41.900
So,

12:42.000 --> 12:43.200
me liking you

12:43.200 --> 12:44.000
is just

12:44.000 --> 12:45.000
my own business.

12:46.120 --> 12:47.720
It has nothing to do with you.

12:47.750 --> 12:49.440
No matter what kind of person you like,

12:49.440 --> 12:50.830
or whatever,

12:50.860 --> 12:52.640
in my heart,

12:52.750 --> 12:54.440
you’ve always been the best.

12:54.440 --> 12:55.720
You're the best.

12:55.720 --> 12:57.390
I’ll always support you.

12:58.430 --> 12:59.430
Really.

13:00.600 --> 13:01.730
Cheers.

13:07.670 --> 13:08.630
So no matter what I say,

13:08.630 --> 13:09.830
you won't believe me?

13:13.720 --> 13:15.120
Then I'll prove it to you.

13:49.150 --> 13:51.920
♪ If frost etched traces of weariness ♪

13:53.490 --> 13:55.360
♪ If surging clouds hid the stars ♪

13:57.180 --> 14:00.110
♪ The gaze you once cast upon me ♪

14:01.020 --> 14:03.730
♪ Does it still remember love and hate? ♪

14:04.740 --> 14:07.610
♪ If the rising wind scatters the dust ♪

14:09.200 --> 14:11.170
♪ If every dream must be awakened ♪

14:13.080 --> 14:15.800
♪ How much of the past can we recognize? ♪

14:16.860 --> 14:21.200
♪ In a single thought lies tenderness ♪

14:22.200 --> 14:29.200
♪ Look at the vast heavens,
letting rain fall, indifferent to all ♪

14:28.290 --> 14:29.580
Do you believe it now?

14:30.270 --> 14:37.170
♪ Watch how time quietly
waits for stories to take root ♪

14:37.930 --> 14:44.800
♪ Look at the way you're going,
destiny has it all planned out ♪

14:46.020 --> 14:56.110
♪ We lead remarkable lives
in this mundane world ♪

14:46.360 --> 14:47.860
I'm speechless.

15:49.440 --> 15:51.500
Your qin skills are excellent.

15:51.630 --> 15:53.510
You expressed the great passion

15:53.510 --> 15:55.240
of Mr. Chu's sword dance piece.

15:56.720 --> 15:59.000
The qin still can't express

15:59.000 --> 16:00.660
the decisiveness of killing.

16:01.320 --> 16:02.120
People say

16:02.120 --> 16:03.870
our lady is extremely talented,

16:03.870 --> 16:05.000
but I know

16:05.200 --> 16:06.790
you have your own

16:06.790 --> 16:08.200
ambitions in your heart.

16:08.750 --> 16:09.790
In this case,

16:10.120 --> 16:11.200
Mr. Chu is indeed

16:11.200 --> 16:13.080
more suitable for you.

16:13.510 --> 16:14.670
A martial artist

16:14.720 --> 16:15.790
is despicable.

16:15.910 --> 16:17.440
He's just a homeless dog.

16:17.720 --> 16:18.600
Then,

16:18.630 --> 16:20.440
do you like the Seventh Prince?

16:20.790 --> 16:22.200
He's scheming

16:22.200 --> 16:23.440
and calculative.

16:23.630 --> 16:25.870
He's just a bug in the gutter.

16:26.440 --> 16:27.790
In that case,

16:27.790 --> 16:29.790
only the Eighteenth Prince is left.

16:30.030 --> 16:30.840
Yinzhu.

16:31.550 --> 16:32.360
Humans

16:32.470 --> 16:34.000
can't fall in love with idiots.

16:34.000 --> 16:36.030
They're another species.

16:36.630 --> 16:37.960
Don't you understand?

16:42.200 --> 16:43.930
Someone like me

16:44.510 --> 16:46.630
should cultivate immortality.

16:48.080 --> 16:51.010
It's a pity that my mother is forcing
me to get married

16:51.630 --> 16:53.270
and fall into the mortal world.

16:53.270 --> 16:54.730
My heart is full of sorrow.

16:55.440 --> 16:56.750
I can't find solace.

16:58.150 --> 16:59.030
Oh, moon,

16:59.910 --> 17:01.150
since ancient times,

17:01.790 --> 17:03.150
are you the only one

17:03.790 --> 17:05.550
who understands my sorrow?

17:15.550 --> 17:16.550
Sir, please wait!

17:20.530 --> 17:23.609
♪ Phantom dragon
lurks in the black market ♪

17:25.510 --> 17:28.329
♪ Radiant lanterns
illuminate the Nightwalkers ♪

17:27.640 --> 17:29.000
Moon Immortal.

17:30.170 --> 17:31.990
♪ In the dark of night,
pure dreams run deep and wide ♪

17:30.270 --> 17:31.350
May I ask

17:31.350 --> 17:32.550
where you came from

17:32.750 --> 17:34.660
♪ Who dares to join the game?
This isn't child's play ♪

17:32.920 --> 17:34.250
and where you're going?

17:34.790 --> 17:35.750
Don't ask where I came from

17:35.180 --> 17:37.690
♪ Footsteps that shake the sky,
fear refuses to fade ♪

17:36.070 --> 17:37.400
or where I'll return to.

17:38.320 --> 17:40.730
♪ Every punch lands
hard on this wild melody ♪

17:42.270 --> 17:43.730
Rivaling the moon's glow,

17:43.920 --> 17:45.160
sailing on the wind.

17:46.110 --> 17:47.530
I didn't expect

17:47.640 --> 17:50.040
that someone in this world
would ignore me.

17:50.920 --> 17:51.720
Shannai,

17:52.000 --> 17:52.750
within one day,

17:52.750 --> 17:54.540
I want all of his information.

17:57.640 --> 17:58.920
I was drunk last night.

17:58.920 --> 18:00.680
You two carried me back to my room?

18:00.680 --> 18:02.160
Did you see anyone else?

18:02.440 --> 18:03.440
Someone else?

18:03.680 --> 18:04.480
My Lady,

18:04.590 --> 18:06.750
I don't know how you came back.

18:10.790 --> 18:13.750
In the skies, may we be birds
flying side by side.

18:14.480 --> 18:16.550
On the ground, may we be besties.

18:18.000 --> 18:19.640
My Lady, you...

18:21.790 --> 18:24.350
Don't worry about having no soulmates.

18:25.790 --> 18:27.590
Best friends' feelings stretch

18:28.070 --> 18:29.330
for millions of miles.

18:29.720 --> 18:30.640
My Lady,

18:30.720 --> 18:32.240
what's wrong?

18:32.270 --> 18:33.960
You're rambling while looking like

18:33.960 --> 18:35.110
you've lost your soul.

18:35.110 --> 18:36.640
What should we do?

18:37.200 --> 18:38.400
How could Li Shiliu

18:38.440 --> 18:40.000
do this to you?

18:40.000 --> 18:41.680
I think you should break up with him

18:41.680 --> 18:43.480
and date General Chu.

18:43.920 --> 18:45.070
My Lady, you have no idea

18:45.070 --> 18:47.200
General Chu visits us every day
these days.

18:47.200 --> 18:49.350
He's about to flatten our doorsteps.

18:50.000 --> 18:50.790
How about

18:50.790 --> 18:51.640
you meet him?

18:51.960 --> 18:52.750
Meet him.

18:55.070 --> 18:56.830
What a bad idea!

18:57.550 --> 18:59.480
You're treating him like a backup.

18:59.550 --> 19:00.350
What?

19:00.400 --> 19:01.480
Forget about that.

19:01.680 --> 19:04.000
You can't be depressed forever.

19:04.110 --> 19:06.430
The best way is to heal a broken heart

19:06.880 --> 19:08.160
is to cut off the old relationship

19:08.160 --> 19:10.000
and start a new one.

19:10.790 --> 19:12.000
If you don't like someone,

19:12.000 --> 19:13.800
you have to reject them clearly.

19:14.110 --> 19:16.030
Acting hesitant and ambiguous

19:16.070 --> 19:17.400
is scumbag behavior.

19:18.640 --> 19:20.500
Anyway, I've thought it through.

19:21.270 --> 19:22.830
I will definitely break off

19:23.640 --> 19:25.500
the engagement with Chu Guihong.

19:25.550 --> 19:27.110
I won't get him involved.

19:27.920 --> 19:30.110
Regardless of the fact that the marriage
is an imperial edict,

19:30.110 --> 19:31.440
My Lady, think about it.

19:31.790 --> 19:34.070
You've only liked Li Shiliu for a few days

19:34.070 --> 19:35.720
and you’ve become like this.

19:36.350 --> 19:38.480
Mr. Chu has liked you
for a dozen years.

19:39.790 --> 19:41.790
Will he do something extreme?

19:44.480 --> 19:45.270
Bravo!

19:46.240 --> 19:47.030
Bravo!

19:49.400 --> 19:50.110
What's going on?

19:50.110 --> 19:51.310
Who are these people?

20:05.310 --> 20:06.200
Mr. Chu,

20:08.200 --> 20:09.400
what's this for?

20:10.510 --> 20:11.970
The Waning River Crescent

20:13.960 --> 20:16.140
posted notices without authorization.

20:16.140 --> 20:17.790
The capital prefecture's office

20:17.790 --> 20:19.400
is here to investigate.

20:21.550 --> 20:22.350
Ridiculous.

20:22.510 --> 20:24.910
What shop in capital doesn't post notices?

20:25.240 --> 20:27.030
Mr. Chu paid a visit

20:27.880 --> 20:29.590
just for

20:30.030 --> 20:31.090
this small matter.

20:36.790 --> 20:38.250
Tell Li Shiliu to come out.

20:39.960 --> 20:41.250
Chief is not here.

20:41.400 --> 20:42.550
I make the decisions

20:42.790 --> 20:44.320
for Waning River Crescent.

20:46.110 --> 20:47.640
Since Li Shiliu is not here,

20:47.640 --> 20:49.640
we'll take you back to
the capital prefecture's office.

20:49.640 --> 20:50.160
Guards!

20:50.160 --> 20:50.830
Stop!

20:58.240 --> 20:59.030
Mr. Chu,

20:59.880 --> 21:02.590
didn’t we work together
on restorations a few days ago?

21:02.590 --> 21:04.250
What's this supposed to mean?

21:06.400 --> 21:08.480
The Qianyu Army received a report.

21:08.550 --> 21:09.690
Last night at midnight,

21:09.690 --> 21:11.750
you sneaked into the Song Residence.

21:12.310 --> 21:13.130
Mr. Li,

21:13.680 --> 21:15.180
can you explain

21:15.270 --> 21:17.160
why you flipped over

21:17.160 --> 21:19.160
the wall at midnight and even entered

21:19.160 --> 21:20.240
the women's ward?

21:21.400 --> 21:22.400
Mr. Chu,

21:23.240 --> 21:24.720
didn’t you just say it's about us posting

21:24.720 --> 21:26.310
notices without authorization?

21:26.310 --> 21:28.640
Why is it about me breaking into
the Song Residence now?

21:28.640 --> 21:31.240
I've been in and out of there many times,

21:31.400 --> 21:33.600
but no one reported it to the officials.

21:34.510 --> 21:35.470
I think

21:35.750 --> 21:37.810
you brought so many people here today

21:38.640 --> 21:40.550
to make a scene, right?

21:46.880 --> 21:48.300
So what?

21:52.490 --> 21:54.940
You told Yimeng to break off
the engagement with me.

21:54.940 --> 21:56.070
Song Yimeng wants to
break off the engagement?

21:56.070 --> 21:57.450
Stop pretending.

21:57.790 --> 21:59.720
Yimeng is getting married with me.

21:59.770 --> 22:01.960
Please stay away from her.

22:03.790 --> 22:05.000
What if I refuse?

22:10.320 --> 22:11.790
[Invitation]

22:12.720 --> 22:14.520
The wedding invitation is here.

22:15.110 --> 22:17.030
No matter how unwilling you are,

22:17.790 --> 22:19.960
don't forget to come to our wedding.

22:26.960 --> 22:28.790
I've been on the battlefield for years.

22:28.790 --> 22:30.920
She has been waiting for me for years.

22:31.680 --> 22:32.970
The wedding date

22:33.200 --> 22:36.270
was decided by Mr. Song and His Majesty.

22:36.790 --> 22:37.640
Li Shiliu,

22:38.630 --> 22:40.640
no matter how capable you are,

22:41.070 --> 22:43.240
you will never affect this marriage.

22:46.680 --> 22:47.790
Mr. Chu,

22:48.260 --> 22:49.900
since you are so confident,

22:51.030 --> 22:52.400
let's make a bet.

22:55.480 --> 22:57.240
I bet I can force you to

22:58.640 --> 22:59.640
cancel

23:00.240 --> 23:02.510
this engagement within 10 days.

23:07.030 --> 23:10.130
[There will be a banquet at my residence
on March 18—Chu Guihong]

23:13.000 --> 23:13.920
Didn't you just say yesterday

23:13.920 --> 23:16.350
you didn't want to get
Song Yimeng involved?

23:16.350 --> 23:19.210
Why did you make her
break off the engagement today?

23:19.350 --> 23:20.830
Things are different now.

23:21.550 --> 23:22.480
Elaborate.

23:22.960 --> 23:24.420
How are things different?

23:27.110 --> 23:28.510
Didn't you hear just now?

23:29.160 --> 23:30.380
Song Yimeng

23:30.590 --> 23:32.680
took the initiative to
break off the engagement.

23:32.680 --> 23:33.830
She doesn’t want to get married.

23:33.830 --> 23:35.000
I'm helping her.

23:35.830 --> 23:37.480
I heard it clearly,

23:37.960 --> 23:39.750
but I have to remind you.

23:39.790 --> 23:42.350
Song Yimeng doesn’t want to
marry Chu Guihong,

23:42.350 --> 23:44.610
but she doesn’t want to marry you either.

23:45.160 --> 23:46.200
Let me put it this way.

23:46.200 --> 23:48.480
She might've considered you
before yesterday,

23:48.480 --> 23:49.440
but now,

23:49.750 --> 23:51.410
because of our relationship,

23:51.830 --> 23:53.240
I don't think so anymore.

23:57.350 --> 23:58.590
Why are you so upset?

23:59.480 --> 24:00.440
Listen.

24:00.990 --> 24:02.850
From now on, stay three steps away

24:03.000 --> 24:04.400
when talking to me.

24:04.480 --> 24:05.200
Otherwise,

24:05.200 --> 24:06.720
I'll stuff you back
into the celestial prison

24:06.720 --> 24:08.070
like how I pulled you out before.

24:08.070 --> 24:08.880
Understand?

24:08.880 --> 24:10.070
Yes, yes.

24:20.200 --> 24:22.030
You talk about sending me back every day.

24:22.030 --> 24:23.760
You don't even spice things up.

24:24.160 --> 24:26.620
No wonder you can't even
handle Song Yimeng.

24:45.490 --> 24:47.830
[Song Residence]

24:54.400 --> 24:56.460
You help me break off the engagement?

24:56.550 --> 24:57.680
Do you think I'm a fool,

24:57.680 --> 24:58.540
Your Highness?

24:59.310 --> 25:01.160
If I break off the engagement
with Chu Guihong

25:01.160 --> 25:02.640
and then marry you,

25:04.030 --> 25:05.240
I'll be the one doing

25:05.240 --> 25:06.680
all the offensive things.

25:06.680 --> 25:07.680
You, on the other hand,

25:07.680 --> 25:09.480
will get all the benefits
of a political marriage

25:09.480 --> 25:11.000
and attacking your enemy.

25:11.820 --> 25:13.650
Wake up, Your Highness.

25:13.830 --> 25:15.030
Stop dreaming.

25:16.920 --> 25:17.830
Song Yimeng,

25:18.550 --> 25:19.510
when can you

25:19.510 --> 25:21.480
be honest with me?

25:22.030 --> 25:23.230
Am I not being honest?

25:23.680 --> 25:24.750
I am.

25:34.400 --> 25:35.200
Here.

25:35.440 --> 25:36.760
Look at this.

25:39.510 --> 25:40.750
The mechanical arm?

25:41.890 --> 25:43.090
What did you do to him?

25:44.160 --> 25:44.830
In your heart,

25:44.830 --> 25:47.070
I'm just a cruel and merciless person.

25:47.160 --> 25:48.690
All of this is normal for me.

25:48.830 --> 25:49.830
Now,

25:49.850 --> 25:51.980
I've only made him suffer a little.

25:52.270 --> 25:53.660
But as long as I want to,

25:54.550 --> 25:56.680
I can kill him anytime.

26:01.510 --> 26:03.040
What makes you think

26:03.510 --> 26:05.190
you can threaten me with him?

26:07.440 --> 26:08.920
Stop pretending with me.

26:09.550 --> 26:11.680
I have many spies in the capital.

26:11.680 --> 26:12.960
I know clearly when you went to

26:12.960 --> 26:14.290
Waning River Crescent,

26:14.470 --> 26:15.750
and when you left.

26:16.480 --> 26:17.540
As long as I want to,

26:17.550 --> 26:19.480
I can also find out

26:19.680 --> 26:20.680
what you said

26:21.680 --> 26:23.430
to Li Shiliu.

26:23.800 --> 26:25.260
As a prince,

26:25.920 --> 26:27.580
you're really rich and idle.

26:28.030 --> 26:29.720
Is a martial artist

26:30.200 --> 26:31.790
worth all your efforts?

26:33.750 --> 26:35.150
It's not him I care about.

26:36.160 --> 26:37.310
It's you.

26:38.480 --> 26:40.110
If you marry Chu Guihong,

26:40.110 --> 26:41.200
the Song family

26:41.200 --> 26:43.600
will definitely fall into Nan Rui's hands.

26:43.790 --> 26:44.830
I'm doing this

26:45.200 --> 26:46.440
to protect myself.

26:47.200 --> 26:48.480
Now, Chu Guihong is holding

26:48.480 --> 26:49.720
a sword over my head.

26:50.170 --> 26:52.400
How can I just sit by and do nothing?

26:54.310 --> 26:57.040
That's why you're threatening me
with Li Shiliu?

26:57.160 --> 26:58.240
How despicable.

27:00.680 --> 27:01.900
Whatever you say.

27:02.310 --> 27:03.270
Anyway,

27:04.350 --> 27:05.680
you have to listen to me.

27:10.030 --> 27:10.830
Stop!

27:14.550 --> 27:17.010
Do you really care about
Li Shiliu this much?

27:17.640 --> 27:18.440
Could it be...

27:20.270 --> 27:21.240
you like him?

27:23.230 --> 27:24.060
Yes.

27:24.310 --> 27:25.110
That's right.

27:25.480 --> 27:26.680
I like him.

27:29.110 --> 27:30.840
What does it have to do with you?

27:34.280 --> 27:35.440
You like him so much

27:35.740 --> 27:37.620
that you're not afraid

27:37.720 --> 27:38.980
I'm manipulating you?

27:42.790 --> 27:44.700
He won't like me anyway.

27:44.880 --> 27:46.790
You can manipulate me however you want.

27:46.790 --> 27:48.070
What if he likes you?

27:48.340 --> 27:49.550
Would you marry him?

27:51.350 --> 27:52.110
Hey,

27:52.110 --> 27:53.570
are you really this bored?

27:53.740 --> 27:55.870
Does this have anything to do with you?

27:58.200 --> 27:59.330
It has nothing to do with me,

27:59.330 --> 28:00.050
but...

28:01.590 --> 28:03.450
I heard that Li Shiliu

28:03.550 --> 28:06.240
and Shangguan He, the Second Master

28:06.240 --> 28:07.000
of Waning River Crescent...

28:07.000 --> 28:08.160
Shut up.

28:08.400 --> 28:09.790
Don't worry about this.

28:13.440 --> 28:15.040
Breaking off the engagement

28:15.400 --> 28:16.830
is not that easy to do.

28:17.640 --> 28:18.510
Give me some time

28:18.510 --> 28:19.810
to think about it.

28:28.750 --> 28:30.230
But before that,

28:31.070 --> 28:33.160
if you dare to hurt Li Shiliu,

28:33.920 --> 28:35.570
I'll make you die with me.

28:35.710 --> 28:36.480
I'll keep my promise.

28:36.480 --> 28:37.200
You hear me?

28:55.550 --> 28:58.160
I thought you'd have to show up
personally as Li Shiliu.

28:58.160 --> 28:59.120
Unexpectedly,

28:59.240 --> 29:00.720
you only used one arm

29:00.720 --> 29:02.880
and Song Yimeng agreed to do the rest.

29:08.550 --> 29:10.070
Why are you still unhappy?

29:11.160 --> 29:12.730
It's not that I'm unhappy.

29:13.550 --> 29:15.160
I just think it's too smooth.

29:15.160 --> 29:16.380
It's strange.

29:17.000 --> 29:18.200
Doesn't Song Yimeng think

29:18.200 --> 29:20.000
Li Shiliu and a loser like you...

29:22.330 --> 29:24.130
Have that kind of relationship?

29:26.790 --> 29:28.960
Then why would she be threatened by me

29:28.960 --> 29:30.620
and break off the engagement?

29:37.240 --> 29:39.440
If it weren't for a loser like me,

29:39.440 --> 29:40.680
Song Yimeng wouldn't have

29:40.680 --> 29:42.290
realized her feelings.

29:42.680 --> 29:43.480
Look,

29:43.960 --> 29:46.350
she knows it's impossible with Li Shiliu,

29:46.350 --> 29:49.010
but she still protects him
without hesitation.

29:53.550 --> 29:55.280
This is love.

29:56.830 --> 29:58.030
Your Highness,

29:58.480 --> 30:00.570
you finally understand love.

30:06.120 --> 30:11.960
[Peace and Serenity]

30:29.240 --> 30:30.380
Anyway,

30:30.510 --> 30:32.470
this is the situation.

30:33.070 --> 30:34.310
I won't marry

30:34.310 --> 30:35.640
someone I don't like.

30:35.920 --> 30:36.720
Father,

30:37.480 --> 30:39.150
I think you should

30:39.270 --> 30:40.730
break off the engagement.

31:04.590 --> 31:04.960
Father,

31:04.960 --> 31:05.750
what are you doing?

31:05.750 --> 31:06.550
Stop!

31:08.070 --> 31:08.880
This thing

31:09.880 --> 31:10.830
was originally prepared

31:10.830 --> 31:13.590
to negotiate with your stepmother, Zhou.

31:14.030 --> 31:15.830
I didn't expect

31:16.270 --> 31:18.480
my good daughter would force me

31:18.480 --> 31:20.270
to this step today.

31:22.310 --> 31:23.480
We can talk.

31:23.480 --> 31:24.240
Come down first.

31:24.240 --> 31:25.110
Don't fall.

31:25.110 --> 31:26.770
What do you want to talk about?

31:28.310 --> 31:29.960
I begged and pleaded

31:30.070 --> 31:31.160
for this engagement's

31:31.160 --> 31:32.880
imperial edict.

31:33.830 --> 31:35.200
The emperor's fury

31:35.590 --> 31:37.200
can cause a million deaths.

31:37.240 --> 31:39.480
Do I have to watch as you jump into danger

31:40.070 --> 31:41.830
and fall into the Seventh Prince's trap

31:41.830 --> 31:43.430
to be used and tricked by him?

31:45.480 --> 31:47.070
The love of parents

31:47.680 --> 31:49.310
is a long-term plan.

31:50.750 --> 31:51.880
Yimeng's mother,

31:53.070 --> 31:53.680
I'm coming to join you!

31:53.680 --> 31:54.480
Alright, alright.

31:54.480 --> 31:55.400
Stop.

31:55.880 --> 31:57.030
Please come down,

31:57.030 --> 31:57.550
Father.

31:57.550 --> 31:58.680
No need to speak further.

31:58.680 --> 32:00.200
I don't need your help anymore.

32:00.200 --> 32:00.920
You

32:00.920 --> 32:02.200
don't need to threaten me with death,

32:02.200 --> 32:03.030
okay?

32:03.070 --> 32:03.830
Alright?

32:03.830 --> 32:04.880
Come on. Get down.

32:04.880 --> 32:05.880
Come down!

32:10.510 --> 32:11.400
Unbelievable.

32:20.680 --> 32:21.540
Your Highness.

32:21.680 --> 32:22.680
Miss Song is here.

32:24.350 --> 32:25.210
Bring her here.

32:25.480 --> 32:25.960
Yes.

32:45.680 --> 32:47.480
Why aren't you saying anything?

32:47.750 --> 32:49.770
Didn't you swear yesterday that

32:49.960 --> 32:51.760
you'd break off the engagement?

32:52.550 --> 32:53.580
Are you here

32:53.960 --> 32:55.290
to give me the good news?

32:58.960 --> 33:00.350
Something happened

33:00.680 --> 33:01.830
with my father.

33:03.920 --> 33:05.350
Anyway, I failed.

33:08.510 --> 33:09.000
Oh?

33:11.440 --> 33:12.680
What?

33:13.510 --> 33:15.480
It's because my father has sharp eyes

33:15.480 --> 33:17.270
and knows you're a vicious villain.

33:17.270 --> 33:18.720
He's sure we have something between us.

33:18.720 --> 33:20.000
That's why he won't break it off.

33:20.000 --> 33:21.200
Are you blaming me?

33:21.350 --> 33:22.240
Of course.

33:26.830 --> 33:27.720
You...

33:28.930 --> 33:29.990
You're so cunning.

33:30.590 --> 33:31.670
Give me an idea.

33:32.060 --> 33:33.460
What should I do?

33:36.090 --> 33:37.290
In the end,

33:37.960 --> 33:39.190
you still need me.

33:45.850 --> 33:48.410
[Song Residence]

33:49.240 --> 33:50.110
Really?

33:50.960 --> 33:51.920
It can't be wrong.

33:51.920 --> 33:52.750
I paid

33:52.750 --> 33:53.400
my cousin's

33:53.400 --> 33:53.880
uncle's

33:53.880 --> 33:54.350
cousin's

33:54.350 --> 33:54.830
aunt's

33:54.830 --> 33:55.270
aunt's

33:55.270 --> 33:55.830
nephew.

33:55.830 --> 33:56.720
Get to the point.

33:56.720 --> 33:58.310
The person who came to
the Song Residence that night

33:58.310 --> 33:59.510
was indeed Li Shiliu.

34:01.680 --> 34:03.140
The capital's top fighter

34:03.550 --> 34:05.750
and Chief of the Waning River Crescent.

34:07.720 --> 34:09.120
I've heard of him before,

34:09.320 --> 34:10.670
but I didn't expect it

34:11.000 --> 34:12.070
to be him.

34:13.670 --> 34:14.480
My Lady,

34:14.800 --> 34:15.880
it's been so many years.

34:15.880 --> 34:17.150
This is the first time

34:17.150 --> 34:18.840
you've ever met someone you liked.

34:18.840 --> 34:19.800
Why don't we

34:19.800 --> 34:20.880
go to Waning River Crescent now?

34:20.880 --> 34:21.630
How about it?

34:24.880 --> 34:26.940
Mother has been watching me closely.

34:27.070 --> 34:28.800
I'm afraid I'll be brought back

34:29.150 --> 34:30.400
before I arrive at a place

34:30.400 --> 34:32.000
like Waning River Crescent.

34:33.310 --> 34:34.830
You're right.

34:35.590 --> 34:36.780
Yiting!

34:37.280 --> 34:38.070
Madam.

34:39.590 --> 34:41.230
Song Yimeng of the first wife's side

34:41.230 --> 34:43.290
has started to prepare for marriage.

34:43.480 --> 34:44.360
How come

34:44.360 --> 34:46.000
there's nothing on your side?

34:46.000 --> 34:46.920
Do you really want to

34:46.920 --> 34:49.449
make Eighteenth Prince
wait until next year?

34:52.190 --> 34:53.360
I'm talking to you.

34:57.670 --> 34:59.110
I'll ask His Highness

34:59.110 --> 35:00.670
to meet up at the Waning River Crescent.

35:00.670 --> 35:01.400
Is that okay?

35:04.110 --> 35:06.320
You finally got it.

35:20.390 --> 35:21.180
How is it?

35:22.230 --> 35:24.480
With my glamorous outfit today,

35:24.480 --> 35:26.840
even if I say I'm the most handsome man
in Great Jing,

35:26.840 --> 35:27.630
I'm afraid

35:27.710 --> 35:29.880
it's not an exaggeration.

35:35.670 --> 35:36.480
Jixiang,

35:36.840 --> 35:37.710
you don't know,

35:37.760 --> 35:38.710
but this is Yiting's

35:38.710 --> 35:40.510
first time asking me out.

35:40.840 --> 35:41.760
I'm afraid

35:42.920 --> 35:44.480
she's finally broken through her fear

35:44.480 --> 35:46.470
and can meet me with confidence.

35:46.670 --> 35:47.590
It's not easy.

35:48.920 --> 35:49.710
What if

35:49.840 --> 35:52.510
she can’t help herself today

35:52.630 --> 35:55.230
and proposes to me?

35:55.230 --> 35:56.840
Should I agree to her immediately

35:56.840 --> 35:57.670
or should I

35:57.670 --> 35:58.840
delay it for a few days

35:58.840 --> 36:00.400
and think about it

36:00.400 --> 36:02.110
before I agree?

36:02.320 --> 36:03.440
Don't worry, Your Highness.

36:03.440 --> 36:05.570
This kind of trouble won't come to you.

36:07.760 --> 36:08.840
Nonsense!

36:08.840 --> 36:09.630
I...

36:09.630 --> 36:10.490
Your Highness,

36:10.550 --> 36:11.210
she's here.

36:13.840 --> 36:14.300
Yiting!

36:14.320 --> 36:14.880
Yiting,

36:14.880 --> 36:15.670
you're here.

36:15.960 --> 36:17.030
Slowly.

36:17.030 --> 36:17.670
Here.

36:17.670 --> 36:18.530
Let me help you.

36:21.030 --> 36:21.920
Let's go.

36:21.940 --> 36:22.920
Yiting, this way.

36:22.920 --> 36:23.710
Yes.

36:23.710 --> 36:24.960
You know the way.

36:25.760 --> 36:27.880
A toad wants to eat swan meat.

36:28.440 --> 36:30.640
The good cabbage has been taken by a pig.

36:36.620 --> 36:38.280
What's this supposed to mean?

36:38.510 --> 36:39.840
Your idea to break off the engagement

36:39.840 --> 36:41.160
is horseback riding?

36:41.960 --> 36:43.300
Your Highness,

36:43.400 --> 36:46.060
you'd better give me a
reasonable explanation.

36:47.280 --> 36:48.030
This is

36:48.230 --> 36:49.580
the imperial stables.

36:50.030 --> 36:50.920
The guards around here

36:50.920 --> 36:52.480
are the Imperial Guards of His Majesty.

36:52.480 --> 36:54.080
If I ride with you alone here,

36:54.110 --> 36:55.280
then within an hour,

36:55.510 --> 36:57.240
His Majesty will hear about it.

36:59.070 --> 37:00.360
This trick again?

37:00.480 --> 37:01.540
So old-fashioned.

37:02.110 --> 37:03.320
How old a trick is doesn't matter,

37:03.320 --> 37:04.580
as long as it works.

37:05.840 --> 37:07.760
The problem is it doesn't work.

37:07.840 --> 37:09.800
A scandal between us

37:09.800 --> 37:10.550
is not enough

37:10.550 --> 37:12.320
to make His Majesty cancel the engagement.

37:12.320 --> 37:14.030
Didn't you fail last time?

37:14.480 --> 37:16.480
You made such a commotion in the palace

37:16.480 --> 37:17.880
and implicated Her Ladyship.

37:17.880 --> 37:19.480
Now you're doing this again.

37:19.710 --> 37:22.170
Aren't you afraid of
offending your father?

37:23.070 --> 37:24.730
I've offended him many times.

37:24.760 --> 37:26.690
Once more won't make a difference.

37:29.650 --> 37:30.480
Come up.

37:31.800 --> 37:33.450
We're riding one horse?

37:41.840 --> 37:42.980
Help!

37:43.030 --> 37:44.110
We're gonna crash!

37:44.110 --> 37:45.320
Slow down!

37:45.320 --> 37:45.800
I'm here.

37:45.800 --> 37:46.710
Why are you so scared?

37:46.710 --> 37:47.840
I'm not afraid of the horse.

37:47.840 --> 37:49.320
I'm afraid of you!

38:03.280 --> 38:04.880
Sky blue Ru porcelain.

38:05.000 --> 38:06.360
Good taste.

38:12.550 --> 38:15.390
Wang Muqing's painting
from the last dynasty.

38:15.760 --> 38:16.890
It's indeed classy.

38:19.360 --> 38:20.740
This table

38:20.960 --> 38:22.440
is Siamese rosewood

38:22.440 --> 38:23.760
with golden thread.

38:23.760 --> 38:25.620
The craftsmanship is exquisite.

38:28.150 --> 38:30.030
The owner of Waning River Crescent

38:30.030 --> 38:31.690
is indeed a wonderful person.

38:35.440 --> 38:36.400
Your Highness,

38:36.670 --> 38:37.800
what's this for?

38:40.840 --> 38:41.800
Miss Song,

38:41.840 --> 38:43.190
pick to your heart's content.

38:43.190 --> 38:44.840
I'll buy anything that you

38:44.840 --> 38:46.110
have a fancy for

38:46.230 --> 38:48.030
and send them to your residence.

38:48.710 --> 38:50.670
Are you flaunting your wealth?

38:51.920 --> 38:52.440
No.

38:52.470 --> 38:52.990
I...

38:53.030 --> 38:53.960
I'm not.

38:53.960 --> 38:54.670
I...

38:56.670 --> 38:57.400
Can you

38:57.400 --> 38:59.280
not be so mean when you see me?

38:59.320 --> 39:00.110
I...

39:01.170 --> 39:02.230
Jixiang, Jixiang.

39:02.540 --> 39:03.800
Put these down.

39:05.840 --> 39:06.630
Yiting,

39:07.030 --> 39:07.840
I want to say

39:08.280 --> 39:08.940
that I pay attention

39:08.940 --> 39:10.380
to your words.

39:10.490 --> 39:12.220
I never treat others like this.

39:15.500 --> 39:17.020
You want to marry me.

39:18.760 --> 39:19.550
Why?

39:21.850 --> 39:23.690
Men and women should marry
when they become of age.

39:23.690 --> 39:25.110
A gentleman pursues a beautiful woman.

39:25.110 --> 39:26.480
What's the problem?

39:26.840 --> 39:28.820
Eighteenth Prince, may I ask you

39:28.920 --> 39:30.710
what marriage means?

39:32.730 --> 39:33.540
It means...

39:35.670 --> 39:36.630
It means...

39:38.630 --> 39:39.480
Well...

39:43.280 --> 39:44.070
Marriage

39:44.230 --> 39:45.490
is when a man and a woman

39:45.550 --> 39:46.510
are willing to accept each other

39:46.510 --> 39:48.120
as their companion.

39:48.670 --> 39:50.840
In sickness and in health,

39:50.840 --> 39:52.620
for richer, for poorer,

39:53.280 --> 39:54.800
they're willing to comfort,

39:54.800 --> 39:55.840
protect,

39:55.840 --> 39:56.590
love,

39:56.590 --> 39:57.710
and respect each other,

39:57.710 --> 39:58.840
never leaving

39:59.070 --> 40:00.320
till death

40:00.400 --> 40:01.710
do them part.

40:04.280 --> 40:05.280
Wait, this...

40:05.280 --> 40:06.400
Which famous

40:06.420 --> 40:08.120
author wrote this line?

40:10.360 --> 40:11.150
Song Yimeng.

40:13.150 --> 40:14.440
My older sister,

40:14.480 --> 40:16.320
Song Yimeng, told me this.

40:19.320 --> 40:20.600
Miss Song,

40:20.670 --> 40:23.400
are you playing with me?

40:23.840 --> 40:26.320
You know very little about me.

40:26.710 --> 40:27.880
You want to marry me

40:27.920 --> 40:30.650
because you don't want to
lose to Seventh Prince.

40:30.920 --> 40:33.480
If it weren't for the matter between
my sister and Seventh Prince

40:33.480 --> 40:35.000
causing a stir in the city,

40:35.110 --> 40:36.480
it wouldn't matter

40:36.590 --> 40:37.710
whether you married

40:37.710 --> 40:38.880
me or not,

40:38.880 --> 40:39.590
right?

40:39.590 --> 40:40.280
No.

40:40.550 --> 40:41.590
Absolutely not.

40:41.590 --> 40:42.840
I really like you.

40:42.840 --> 40:44.840
And Father also thinks you are good.

40:44.960 --> 40:47.030
You're the one getting married,
not His Majesty.

40:47.030 --> 40:48.440
You keep talking about His Majesty.

40:48.440 --> 40:49.880
Are you getting married

40:49.880 --> 40:51.440
or is His Majesty getting another consort?

40:51.440 --> 40:52.280
I... No.

40:52.280 --> 40:53.480
I mean, I...

40:54.840 --> 40:55.630
This...

40:56.000 --> 40:56.800
I'm sorry.

40:57.840 --> 40:59.230
Forgive me for being rude.

40:59.230 --> 41:00.030
Yiting.

41:00.150 --> 41:00.960
Yiting?

41:00.960 --> 41:01.670
Hey,

41:01.670 --> 41:03.440
did I not make myself clear?

41:05.760 --> 41:06.960
It's only been an hour

41:06.960 --> 41:08.480
and I've learned how to ride horses.

41:08.480 --> 41:09.840
How is it, Your Highness?

41:09.840 --> 41:10.960
Not bad, right?

41:12.030 --> 41:13.510
It's because I'm a good teacher.

41:13.510 --> 41:14.320
However,

41:14.440 --> 41:15.710
the battlefield's war stallions

41:15.710 --> 41:17.960
aren't as good as
the palace's tame horses.

41:17.960 --> 41:19.090
On the battlefield,

41:19.280 --> 41:21.250
there's not enough food for the horses.

41:21.250 --> 41:22.850
Many of them are injured too.

41:23.280 --> 41:24.880
In a battle, no matter if it's an arrow

41:24.880 --> 41:25.920
or cannons,

41:26.070 --> 41:28.480
they'll all affect
your control of the horse.

41:28.480 --> 41:30.280
Don't make it sound so miserable.

41:30.280 --> 41:32.150
Isn't it your choice?

41:32.470 --> 41:33.550
Everyone knows that Seventh Prince

41:33.550 --> 41:35.320
fights on the battlefield

41:35.630 --> 41:37.030
to win military merits.

41:41.030 --> 41:41.840
Am I right?

41:44.590 --> 41:45.400
Yes.

41:45.920 --> 41:47.880
Winning military merits and seeking fame.

41:47.880 --> 41:48.960
You're right.

41:50.140 --> 41:51.690
You sound sarcastic.

41:54.230 --> 41:56.490
You won't believe me no matter what I say.

41:56.800 --> 41:58.760
Everyone in Great Jing knows

41:59.030 --> 42:01.690
His Majesty doesn't like me
because of the past.

42:02.360 --> 42:04.840
If I don't go to the frontier
to kill the enemy,

42:04.840 --> 42:07.160
is there any other way for me to survive?

42:08.030 --> 42:10.320
Going to war is a dangerous thing.

42:10.320 --> 42:11.510
Why is it

42:11.510 --> 42:12.920
a means to save yourself?

42:15.310 --> 42:16.650
When I was nine,

42:16.950 --> 42:18.280
I was banished to the cold palace.

42:18.280 --> 42:19.150
I'll starve you to death!

42:19.150 --> 42:20.150
I was mistreated,

42:20.150 --> 42:21.350
and went hungry.

42:22.110 --> 42:23.410
I was even thrown into the fire

42:23.410 --> 42:25.080
and had my food poisoned.

42:25.410 --> 42:27.340
His Majesty knew about all of this,

42:27.840 --> 42:29.740
but he never cared about it.

42:33.990 --> 42:35.150
I won't kill you.

42:36.400 --> 42:38.980
Chop off the hand

42:39.630 --> 42:40.550
that you used

42:40.960 --> 42:42.620
to break Rui's arm.

42:45.760 --> 42:48.280
Or do you want people to insult me

42:48.360 --> 42:51.260
as a tyrant who kills his subjects?

42:56.360 --> 42:58.220
You are father and son.

42:58.260 --> 42:59.950
How can you be such enemies?

43:01.550 --> 43:03.800
There are no father and son
in the imperial court.

43:03.800 --> 43:05.230
Everything I have now

43:05.720 --> 43:07.620
was earned by fighting

43:08.110 --> 43:10.040
through seas of corpses and blood.

43:13.190 --> 43:14.880
With this kind of backstory,

43:15.480 --> 43:17.880
it's no wonder his personality is twisted.

43:18.760 --> 43:19.740
No, no.

43:19.960 --> 43:22.070
How can I sympathize with him?

43:24.000 --> 43:24.860
Song Yimeng,

43:25.150 --> 43:26.590
don't be a Mary Sue.

43:26.760 --> 43:27.550
Wake up.

43:44.190 --> 43:45.740
We're in the capital now,

43:46.000 --> 43:47.550
but we can't become out of shape.

43:47.550 --> 43:48.360
Have our men

43:48.360 --> 43:49.480
practice hard.

43:49.480 --> 43:50.480
Yes, General.

43:52.760 --> 43:53.550
General.

43:55.280 --> 43:56.070
General.

43:57.550 --> 43:58.360
Look.

44:11.030 --> 44:11.840
Here.

44:15.150 --> 44:16.550
I can come down by myself.

44:17.360 --> 44:18.510
Let go of me!

44:19.110 --> 44:19.800
Let go!

44:19.800 --> 44:20.930
Chu Guihong is here.

44:21.630 --> 44:22.670
Don’t look.

44:22.920 --> 44:24.440
A short pain is better than a long one.

44:24.440 --> 44:26.550
Whether you can break off the engagement
or not depends on this.

44:26.550 --> 44:27.750
What do you want to do?

44:32.450 --> 44:33.580
What are they doing?

44:36.360 --> 44:37.230
Nan Heng,

44:37.280 --> 44:38.590
do you want to die?

44:38.590 --> 44:39.840
Let go of me!

44:40.580 --> 44:41.650
Do you hear me?

44:47.590 --> 44:48.530
General.

44:48.670 --> 44:49.480
General.

44:49.480 --> 44:50.510
Calm down.

44:50.710 --> 44:51.990
He is a prince.

44:52.510 --> 44:53.610
Nan Heng!

44:53.710 --> 44:54.670
Let go of her!
